Hi Andreas

(I never received the mail of 09 June from Charles. I don't know what 
address he sent it to.)

I have consulted GPC author Alan Murta and I regret to tell you that 
there are no plans to change the licensing arrangements for GPC. He has 
asked me to mention that there are other, free, polygon cliiping 
libraries, such as Clipper (http://www.angusj.com/delphi/clipper.php) 
which you may wish to use instead.

With best wishes

Toby

